# Not Dead After All: the Wicked Role is created under the ability's controller, so when it later goes to the
# graveyard (here Bot1 destroys it with its own Disenchant on turn 3), the opponent loses 1 life (Wicked's trigger,
# CR 603.10a). The Ornithopter is bolted on turn 1 and returns with the Role (1/3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Not Dead After All
Disenchant
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

