Bot1.Hand.Not Dead After All.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
